<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2951] Cluster is unstable when there are more than 500 clients</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2951</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;To reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start three servers with 4GB heap.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start 500 clients on parallel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Server nodes will eventually run out of memory of fail with various exceptions in discovery.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12956398">IGNITE-2951</key>
            <summary>Cluster is unstable when there are more than 500 clients</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
