                                    <component>general</component>
                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>2</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15231103" author="vkulichenko" created="Thu, 7 Apr 2016 21:27:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The following is done:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Removed serialization buffer from discovery message worker. This fixed OOM issues.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fixed race in continuous processor. &lt;tt&gt;clientInfos&lt;/tt&gt; map was not copied before adding to the message. This could cause concurrent serialization and modification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Changes are committed to master: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/5e266153707021a8866e91dfa3f958066f80fc99&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/commit/5e266153707021a8866e91dfa3f958066f80fc99&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15231147" author="agoncharuk" created="Thu, 7 Apr 2016 21:46:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Changes look good to me.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
